+## AWS resources
+
+| Resource | Value |
+|---|---|
+| API Gateway | `serverless-hr-api`, stage `prod` |
+| Application URL | https://ioy99699v8.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod |
+| UI Lambda | `hr-ui-function` |
+| Backend Lambda | `hr-backend-lookup` |
+| DynamoDB table | `Employees`, partition key `EmployeeID` |
+| Cognito User Pool | `us-east-1_yLlaBkBX6` |
+| Managed Login domain | `https://us-east-1yllabkbx6.auth.us-east-1.amazoncognito.com` |
+
+## Deployment summary
+
+1. Create the `Employees` DynamoDB table with `EmployeeID` as a String partition key.
+2. Insert employee records, including student record `1005`.
+3. Create the IAM policy allowing only `dynamodb:GetItem` on `Employees`.
+4. Attach the policy to the Lambda execution role `HRBackendLambdaRole`.
+5. Deploy `hr-backend-lookup` and `hr-ui-function`.
+6. Create API Gateway resources and Lambda proxy integrations.
+7. Create the Cognito User Pool, public client, Managed Login domain, and PKCE callback URL.
+8. Create the Cognito authorizer and protect `GET /employee/{id}`.
+9. Deploy the API to the `prod` stage.
+
+## Testing
+
+| Test | Expected result |
+|---|---|
+| Open the application URL | UI loads over HTTPS |
+| Sign in through Cognito | User authenticates successfully |
+| Search `1001` | Alice Chan record is displayed |
+| Search `1005` | Nitish Kumar and the student IAM ARN are displayed |
+| Search `99999` | `Employee not found` is displayed |
+| Call `/employee/1001` without a token | API returns `401 Unauthorized` |
+
+Detailed evidence is in [`screenshots/`](screenshots/) and [`docs/`](docs/).
+
+## Repository contents
+
+- `backend/`: backend Lambda source
+- `ui/`: UI Lambda source
+- `docs/`: Functional Specification, diagrams, API export, and AI assistance record
+- `screenshots/`: AWS configuration and test evidence
+
+## Security notes
+
+Do not commit AWS access keys, secret keys, passwords, client secrets, authorization codes, or tokens. The Cognito client is public and uses PKCE; it does not contain a client secret.
+
+## Cleanup
+
+After submission and instructor approval, remove assignment-only API Gateway, Lambda, DynamoDB, Cognito, IAM, and EC2 resources to avoid unnecessary charges.
+
+## Author
+
+Nitish Kumar — https://github.com/nitishhrms/serverless-hr-lookup
